## Subsystem-Specific Commands

| Command | Purpose | Format | Validation |
|---------|---------|--------|------------|
| `continue-implementation` | Continue subsystem implementation | `continue-implementation: subsystem-name @parameters/rules/continue-implementation-subsystem.mdc` | Requires subsystem-name |
| `continue-implementation` | Continue with recovery point | `continue-implementation: subsystem-name recovery-point @parameters/rules/continue-implementation-subsystem.mdc` | Requires subsystem-name and recovery-point |
| `implementation-status` | Request subsystem status | `implementation-status: subsystem-name` | Requires subsystem-name |

